{"4582550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kabsa Spilled?", "steam_appid": 4582550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5043820], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Either you love Meat Kabsa so much (like me) or you never heard of it, this game likely will change your  minds about that..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582550/extras/0a7fd31c17414283544dc3ab1937a067.avif?t=1788282730\" width=1076 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in this funny physics Co-op game, you and your mate have to deliver the right amount of Kabsa Rice and Meat Pieces to the VIP customers of the Old themed Arabian restaurant, Each Garson on each side Balancing the Big, Hot and Weighted Kabsa Plate through the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Pour and Get Ready To Go</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Day, Get your plate ready! pouring the right amount of Kabsa Rice and Meat Pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582550/extras/032161743bd95d17cba78cb631b5e21e.poster.avif?t=1788282730\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582550/extras/032161743bd95d17cba78cb631b5e21e.webm?t=1788282730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582550/extras/032161743bd95d17cba78cb631b5e21e.mp4?t=1788282730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Don't Spill!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please don't ruin my perfect-made Kabsa dinner..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\