s=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Features:</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Plate Balancing and Physics.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer, Couch-Party &amp; Online Co-op modes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Timer and Death Counter for <i>speedrunner heroes</i>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arabic Themed Old Places Vibe.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So much fun and pain in one place.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Finally<strong>, About Me:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582550/extras/6ef8aeacab4dfd820aa65152e59fa517.poster.avif?t=1788282730\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582550/extras/6ef8aeacab4dfd820aa65152e59fa517.webm?t=1788282730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582550/extras/6ef8aeacab4dfd820aa65152e59fa517.mp4?t=1788282730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am Moayad, A new father and a solo game dev, worked on this game with love and passion, it's my first Co-op game and I really hope to see you people &quot;Enjoy&quot; it!  (and No, I don't smoke). Peace ❤️</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Either you love Meat Kabsa so much (like me) or you never heard of it, this game likely will change your  minds about that..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582550/extras/0a7fd31c17414283544dc3ab1937a067.avif?t=1788282730\" width=1076 